<title>HONG KONG: CEF Concord interim net loss HK$24.48 mln.</title>
<headline>CEF Concord interim net loss HK$24.48 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   10.0 loss  vs 244.0 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  6.41 gain  vs 13.90 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    24.48 loss vs 197.46 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     221.16     vs 180.72</p>
<p>    Company name		 CEF Concord Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - CEF Concord, formerly Hoi Sing Holdings Ltd, is a construction and engineering company.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain mainly on translation of the Swiss Francs convertible notes.</p>
<p>Comparative share earnings have been adjusted for the rights issue and consolidation of four-into-one share during 1995.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
